	(text "MCU BOARD LINK: J6/J7 1x10 2.54 mm male headers (plastic on the carrier F side);\nthe ESP32-S3 MCU board (32bit-mcu) solders on top. RESET (EN) / BOOT (GPIO0) on the carrier B side:\nhold BOOT, press RESET = ESP32-S3 ROM download mode on the USB-C (recovery only)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 449.58 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "077bfba9-c110-5844-9d33-b5b52344ce3b")
	)
	(text "CONTROLS (firmware-defined): RV1 / RV2 50k on the ESP32-S3 ADC1 (0..3.03 V), SW3 MODE to GND,\nMODE LED D3 through R53 1k. Not in the audio path."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 360.68 320.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0dc80846-6d0b-5d0b-8ac9-9a6c58a7dcab")
	)
	(text "POWER: +12V -> D2 -> +12V_F (op-amps; U1 AMS1117-5.0 -> +5VA; R1 22R -> U2 AMS1117-3.3 -> +3V3 -> FB1 -> +3V3_C); -12V -> D1 -> -12V_F"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1290b2c0-ad1d-504c-865d-33839c726385")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG: GND/+12V/-12V at J1; +12V_F/-12V_F behind D2/D1; V3_IN behind R1; +3V3_C behind FB1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "43426e25-1354-5bb0-9637-a85ad0228da7")
	)
	(text "CS4272 CODEC: I2C control port, address 0x10, 100 kHz. Master, external MCLK 24.576 MHz (XTI = GND):\n512 / 256 / 128 x Fs = 48 / 96 / 192 kHz (Ratio1:0 = 10); SCLK = 64 x Fs to the ESP32-S3 I2S slave.\nFirmware: RST high, write 03h to 07h (CPEN + PDN) within 10 ms, set the registers, clear PDN.\nSCLK / LRCK are codec inputs until the M/S bit is set: R14 / R16 hold them low (no floating clocks).\nTP1: MCLK scope pad on the back; SCLK, LRCK, ADC, DAC, RST, GND: J7 solder joints (B silk)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "47853dd8-bec8-5f55-a01d-b9f3874e6634")
	)
	(text "I2S series termination (at the codec)\nand pull-downs"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 154.94 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "753ecf4d-133c-5196-a3df-1e4204d8a60b")
	)
	(text "REFERENCE (+5VA): R49 over R40 + R41 = 0.482 x VA = 2.41 V -> VCOM_BUF (unity inverters, C38 / C39) and\nVB_IN = VCOM_BUF x 2/2.51 (input drivers, no capacitor). It only sets the ADC common mode;\nthe codec VCOM pin is not loaded. No buffer op-amp (S5)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 309.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a81e406f-59b4-5a0a-b2b8-eb4b4985dabc")
	)
	(text "INPUTS: jack (TN = GND, R50/R51 100k to GND) -> 1k -> U4A/B NE5532 follower (+/-12 V)\n-> U6 inverting driver on +5VA (-0.255, + at VB_IN) = AIN-; U6 unity inverter about VCOM_BUF = AIN+;\n100R per leg, 2.2n C0G across the pair. +/-5.54 V = 5.65 Vpp differential ADC full scale."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "bba8acae-2037-54b2-b72a-5d4b703c0bac")
	)
	(text "BIG MODULAR 32BIT - carrier (jack board), S4: modules/usb-audio S5 audio path + ESP32-S3 MCU board. 2 in / 2 out, DC-coupled +/-5 V, CS4272. Circuit intent: docs/research.md; placement: docs/geometry.json"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "cf6d2b6e-f05c-552f-a127-17309c49002e")
	)
	(text "OUTPUTS: AOUT+/- -> U5A/B difference amplifier (6.8k / 15k, 100p: x2.2, 106 kHz)\n-> 2k || 2k (1k / 0.5W) -> jack. 4.8 Vpp differential DAC full scale -> +/-5.29 V.\nThe codec common mode (VCOM) cancels: 0 V out at mid-scale and while the codec is in reset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 322.58 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "fa8e51ab-fc07-50e2-87c3-0edaf50982a3")
	)
